# Gitea uses Go regular expressions, not GitHub glob syntax.
# Advisory review requests; the owner-controlled merger independently enforces
# owner approval on these paths using its own policy and the current PR SHA.
^CODEOWNERS$ @whiskey
^[.]gitea/.* @whiskey
^[.]github/.* @whiskey
^docs/CODEOWNERS$ @whiskey
^Dockerfile$ @whiskey
^[.]dockerignore$ @whiskey
^pyproject[.]toml$ @whiskey
^[.]pre-commit-config[.]yaml$ @whiskey
^security/.* @whiskey
^deploy/.* @whiskey
^infrastructure/.* @whiskey
